  1208	    /// Copy over the entire contents of another archive verbatim.
  1209	    ///
  1210	    /// This method extracts file metadata from the `source` archive, then simply performs a single
  1211	    /// big [`io::copy()`](io::copy) to transfer all the actual file contents without any
  1212	    /// decompression or decryption. This is more performant than the equivalent operation of
  1213	    /// calling [`Self::raw_copy_file()`] for each entry from the `source` archive in sequence.
  1214	    ///
  1215	    ///```
